</script></head><body class=\"app-root\"><main class=\"landing-shell\"><div class=\"landing-bg-scales\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 720\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"90\" r=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"90\" r=\"8\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"600\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></line><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"210\" r=\"7\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"></line><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"></line><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"></line><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"></line><line x1=\"520\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"></line><line x1=\"480\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"></line><path d=\"M55 362 Q100 382 145 362\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\"></path><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"362\" x2=\"145\" y2=\"362\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><path d=\"M475 362 Q520 382 565 362\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\"></path><line x1=\"475\" y1=\"362\" x2=\"565\" y2=\"362\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"600\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"600\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"620\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"620\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></line><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"636\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"636\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"210\" r=\"6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\"></circle><circle cx=\"540\" cy=\"210\" r=\"6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\"></circle><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"370\" r=\"30\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.7\" fill=\"none\"></circle><circle cx=\"520\" cy=\"370\" r=\"30\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.7\" fill=\"none\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"landing-bg-section-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">§</div><div class=\"landing-frame\"><header class=\"landing-nav\"><a class=\"landing-brand\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"landing-brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>LegalOS</span></a><div class=\"landing-nav-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary ui-button-md\" href=\"/login\">Get Started</a></div></header><section class=\"landing-hero\" id=\"platform\"><div class=\"landing-hero-copy\"><p class=\"landing-eyebrow\">One workspace for legal teams that need clarity.</p><h1 class=\"landing-title\">Run your firm from one case-centric workspace.</h1><p class=\"landing-copy\">Deadlines, documents, billing, and client updates stay anchored to the matter they belong to.</p><div class=\"landing-inline-proof\"><div class=\"landing-inline-proof-item\"><strong>4.9 hrs</strong><span>Saved weekly</span></div><div class=\"landing-inline-proof-item\"><strong>Audit-first</strong><span>Every update stays traceable</span></div></div></div><aside class=\"landing-hero-stage\" aria-label=\"Workspace preview\"><div class=\"landing-stage-card\"><div class=\"landing-stage-topbar\"><div><p class=\"landing-stage-kicker\">Matter pulse</p><h2>Asante v. Mensah Industries</h2></div><span class=\"landing-stage-chip\">Hearing in 2 days</span></div><div class=\"landing-stage-stack\"><section class=\"landing-stage-surface landing-stage-summary\"><div><span class=\"landing-stage-label\">Outstanding invoices</span><strong>GHS 18,760</strong><p>Draft ready for review on the employment brief.</p></div><div class=\"landing-stage-mini-chart\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></section><div class=\"landing-stage-floating-card\"><span class=\"landing-floating-kicker\">Today</span><strong>3 actions need partner review</strong><p>2 extracted deadlines and 1 client summary draft.</p></div><section class=\"landing-stage-surface landing-stage-activity\"><div class=\"landing-stage-row\"><span class=\"landing-stage-time\">09:00</span><div><strong>Hearing bundle check</strong><p>Court filing references verified and assigned to Ama Osei.</p></div></div><div class=\"landing-stage-row\"><span class=\"landing-stage-time\">12:30</span><div><strong>Invoice narrative prepared</strong><p>Time entries grouped into a draft for internal review.</p></div></div><div class=\"landing-stage-row\"><span class=\"landing-stage-time\">16:10</span><div><strong>Client update staged</strong><p>Portal-ready summary linked to the latest filed document.</p></div></div></section></div></div></aside></section><section class=\"landing-performance-section\" id=\"proof\"><div class=\"landing-section-head landing-section-head-centered\"><div><p class=\"landing-section-kicker\">Operational calm</p><h2 class=\"landing-section-title\">The team moves faster when the record stays intact.</h2></div></div><div class=\"landing-performance-grid\"><article class=\"landing-performance-card\"><strong>5 hrs</strong><h3>Saved each week</h3><p>Fewer follow-up loops across deadlines, billing, and internal review.</p></article><article class=\"landing-performance-card\"><strong>98%</strong><h3>Matter context retained</h3><p>Updates, evidence, and assignees stay anchored to the underlying record.</p></article><article class=\"landing-performance-card\"><strong>24h</strong><h3>Faster invoice turnaround</h3><p>Drafts, narratives, and collections move without leaving the workspace.</p></article><article class=\"landing-performance-card\"><strong>3 rails</strong><h3>One operating rhythm</h3><p>Legal work, review, and client visibility stay in the same flow.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"landing-story-section\"><div class=\"landing-story-copy\"><p class=\"landing-section-kicker\">Organized by design</p><h2 class=\"landing-section-title\">Keep the firm aligned without rebuilding context every morning.</h2><p class=\"landing-section-copy\">Tasks, updates, and collections feel lighter when the workspace keeps the whole practice pointed at the same record.</p></div><div class=\"landing-story-rail\"><article class=\"landing-story-rail-card\"><span class=\"landing-story-rail-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div><h3>Calendar sync</h3><p>Hearings, filing windows, and internal deadlines stay visible in the same operating layer.</p></div></article><article class=\"landing-story-rail-card\"><span class=\"landing-story-rail-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div><h3>Document trails</h3><p>Evidence, drafts, and shared bundles remain attached to the matter instead of disappearing into folders.</p></div></article><article class=\"landing-story-rail-card\"><span class=\"landing-story-rail-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div><h3>Billing visibility</h3><p>Time, invoice drafts, and collection status are always close to the legal work that created them.</p></div></article></div></section><section class=\"landing-showcase-section\"><div class=\"landing-showcase-head\"><p class=\"landing-section-kicker\">Practice visibility</p><h2 class=\"landing-section-title\">Simplify practice visibility for modern legal teams.</h2><p class=\"landing-section-copy landing-showcase-copy\">Clear case tasks, deadlines, and shared goals make the whole practice easier to steer.</p></div><div class=\"landing-visibility-grid\" aria-label=\"Practice visibility highlights\"><article class=\"landing-visibility-card\"><span class=\"landing-visibility-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div><h3>Entire team aligned</h3><p>Keep case tasks, shared goals, and live updates visible in the same operating layer.</p></div></article><article class=\"landing-visibility-card\"><span class=\"landing-visibility-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div><h3>5 hours/week saved</h3><p>Reduce routine follow-up by keeping deadlines, review points, and billing cues in view.</p></div></article><article class=\"landing-visibility-card\"><span class=\"landing-visibility-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div><h3>10% lower churn</h3><p>Smoother handoffs and clearer client visibility help the practice feel more dependable.</p></div></article><article class=\"landing-visibility-card\"><span class=\"landing-visibility-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div><h3>200+ review signals</h3><p>Track approvals, upload requests, and invoice touchpoints without losing the matter context.</p></div></article></div></section><footer class=\"landing-footer\"><div class=\"landing-footer-inner\"><div class=\"landing-footer-brand\"><a class=\"landing-brand\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"landing-brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>LegalOS</span></a><p>A Ghana-first legal operating system for case clarity, billing visibility, and review-first team work.</p></div><div class=\"landing-footer-columns\"><div class=\"landing-footer-column\"><h3>Platform</h3><a href=\"#platform\">Matter workspace</a><a href=\"#proof\">Proof points</a><a href=\"#workflow\">Workflow</a></div><div class=\"landing-footer-column\"><h3>Company</h3><a href=\"/register\">Create workspace</a><a href=\"/login\">Staff sign in</a><a href=\"/portal\">Client portal</a></div><div class=\"landing-footer-column\"><h3>Learn</h3><a href=\"/dashboard\">Dashboard preview</a><a href=\"/cases\">Case workspace preview</a><a href=\"/settings\">Settings preview</a></div></div></div></footer></div></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-26cefa2138c04ade.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||